Package: ktonrec
Title: Command Boundaries for the kton Recorder
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("kton", "contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "noreply@kton.dev")
Description: Writes command boundaries (TASK), sourced files (SOURCE), the
    environment (ENV) and changed variables (VARS) into the event log that
    libktontrace.so writes, so that ktonwatch can tell which file access
    belonged to which command. Records nothing by itself and executes nothing.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
